<title>USA: Casino Airlink nine-month oper shr $0.07.</title>
<headline>Casino Airlink nine-month oper shr $0.07.</headline>
<dateline>FT. LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Casino Airlink Inc said Tuesday that net income for the nine months ended October 31 was about $330,000, or $0.07 per share, on revenues of about $15 million from continuing operations.</p>
<p>The company also said it lost $1.1 million from operations discontinued in the first six months of the year.</p>
<p>Further information was not immediately available.</p>
</text>
